[32m+[m[32m# \## Overview[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m[41m [m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# GlamDesk is a centralized salon management platform for scheduling, staff allocation, inventory, and client management.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m[41m [m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# The proposed system will help a salon record bookings and manage clients, staff, and stock in one place.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m[41m [m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \*Explain the intended benefit in your own words:\* It replaces manual logs, reduces double-bookings, streamlines front-desk operations, maximizes bookings, eliminates delays, and elevates the client experience. It fixes overbooking, high no-shows, inefficient allocation, and unmonitored inventory.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \## Scope[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- In scope: 24/7 Online Booking - client picks service, stylist, and time slot.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- In scope: Interactive Calendar - real-time staff, service, and chair assignment.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- In scope: Automated Reminders - SMS and email alerts that reduce no-shows.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- In scope: Point of Sale \& Billing - multi-payment, vouchers, and digital invoices.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- In scope: Inventory Tracking - product usage and low-stock alerts.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- Out of scope: Product delivery \& courier logistics.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- Out of scope: Off-site beauty dispatch \& GPS tracking.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- Out of scope: Direct factory supply procurement.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- Limitation: Real-time sync needs stable internet, service times vary by client needs, SMS depends on gateway \& telecom coverage.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \## Stakeholders[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*Salon Client:\* Books services, pays, gets reminders, checks transparent pricing and preferred stylist.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*Front Desk / Receptionist:\* Uses calendar, check-in, visit history, simple billing.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*Stylist:\* Needs to know daily schedule, service duration, and commissions.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*Owner / Manager - Instructor jaisa role:\* Needs to know revenue analytics, occupancy rates, staff performance, and real-time inventory. Needs to know which bookings are pending, which staff is free, and whether salon is on track.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*Project maintainer - System Administrator:\* Needs to manage security, high availability, role-based access, permissions, updates, database, and smooth performance. Needs to manage Stripe payments and Twilio / SendGrid messaging configuration.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \## Functional requirements[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*FR-01:\* The system shall let a client create a booking with service, stylist, and time slot.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*FR-02:\* The system shall display the salon's saved bookings in a real-time calendar.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*FR-03:\* The system shall let the system send reminders and let a client / staff mark a booking complete / cancelled.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*FR-04:\* The system shall process billing with multi-payment, vouchers, and digital invoices.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*FR-05:\* The system shall track inventory and show low-stock alerts.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \## Nonfunctional requirements[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*NFR-01:\* With 100 saved bookings, the booking list / calendar shall appear within 2 seconds in at least 95 of 100 trials on an agreed test device. Online booking shall complete within 45 seconds.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*NFR-02:\* Every booking action - create, view, cancel, mark complete - shall give visible feedback within 1 second, e.g. booking appears, confirmation shows, or tick shows.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*NFR-03:\* The system shall work on desktop browsers, front-desk tablets, and mobile client app as Cloud SaaS, without double-booking.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# \- \*NFR-04:\* No-show rate shall reduce by 45% via reminders, front-desk phone time shall reduce by 50% within 3 months, and inventory accuracy shall be 95%+.[m
[32m+[m
